  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Near the village a small natural grassland is more desolate than Northern Plains ground: sand everywhere and sharp red dagger grass blades that stab deep for meager water.",
      "chapters": [
        674
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Near Han village, a small natural grassland holds sand and sharp red dagger grass that local children cut with sickles for family pay. The blades stab deep for meager water; the children wear leather gloves, and one bare handed child grinds cut grass at a quern-stone into paste for fat sand scorpions kept as the household’s main assets.",
      "chapters": [
        674
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dagger-grass-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Only one rank two Gu Master is stationed there to look after the village.",
      "chapters": [
        676
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dagger-grass-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From a graveyard several li away, Fang Yuan watches Han village at night with up to a thousand investigative Gu and puts the whole village under his supervision. Luck inspection Gu shows a thin grey-white luck cloud above the village from the villagers’ collective belonging.",
      "chapters": [
        674
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "watch-from-the-graveyard",
